## Update Guidelines

- **Frequency**: Update when facts change
- **Source**: Tag with source (conversation, document, observation)
- **Validation**: Verify before updating
- **History**: Keep old values with timestamps

## Example Update

```yaml
# Before
python_version: "3.10"
last_verified: "2026-01-15"

# After
python_version: "3.12"
last_verified: "2026-03-13"
source: "system upgrade conversation"
previous_versions:
  - "3.10" (until 2026-03-13)
```